Description: SeuratSourcery provides a streamlined workflow for loading, 
    harmonizing, and inspecting multiple single-cell RNA sequencing datasets. 
    The package standardizes gene naming, metadata structures, and feature 
    compatibility across diverse file formats (.rds, .h5ad, .loom, .csv, 
    and 10x directories), making datasets ready for downstream analysis in 
    Seurat. It offers automated quality-control summaries, overlap metrics, 
    and harmonization utilities that simplify multi-dataset integration.
